  <data name="Controls_Settings_AiSettingsSection__Run_1.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Powered by Phi Silica running on your PC's neural processor (NPU). Inference is on-device. To reduce hallucinations, the app also fetches short anonymous music-specific metadata snippets, with Wikipedia only as a fallback, and feeds them as supporting context for each answer. Available only on Copilot+ PCs (Snapdragon X, Intel Core Ultra Series 2, AMD Ryzen AI 300+) running Windows 11 24H2.</value>
  </data>
